            <p>For more details, please refer to our <a href="terms-of-service.html">Terms of Service</a>.</p>

            <h2>ARTICLE 5: Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>The information contained on this Site is as accurate as possible, and the Site is periodically updated, but may nonetheless contain inaccuracies or omissions. If you notice an inaccuracy, error, or what appears to be a malfunction, please report it by email to <a href="mailto:info@ezra-project.fr">info@ezra-project.fr</a>, describing the problem as precisely as possible (problematic page, triggering action, type of computer and browser used, etc.).</p>
            <p>Ezra Maroc Consulting Services LLC cannot be held liable for any direct or indirect damage caused to the user's equipment when accessing the Site, resulting either from the use of equipment that does not meet the indicated specifications or from the appearance of a bug or incompatibility.</p>
            <p>For more details, please refer to our <a href="terms-of-service.html">Terms of Service</a>.</p>

