            <p>For any questions or information concerning the Site, or any report of illegal content or activities, the User may contact the Editor at the following email address: <a href="mailto:info@ezra-project.fr">info@ezra-project.fr</a>, or send a registered letter with acknowledgment of receipt to Ezra Maroc Consulting Services LLC at the address specified in Article 1.</p>

